# The image needs source and one manifest. Everything else in this repo is data.
#
# Without this the build context is ~2GB: exit_sweep_paths.parquet alone is
# 342MB and user_data/data/ is 247MB, none of which the live system reads. The
# context is tarred and sent to the builder before a single layer is built, so
# it is pure cost on every build.
*
!requirements.txt
!Dockerfile.trading
!research/**/*.py
!user_data/normalized/manifest.json

# Re-exclude things the globs above would otherwise drag back in.
research/retired_nautilus_paper/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
